            "text": "<p>I’m Mark Lyall, an MSc-qualified Personal Trainer with a passion for helping people build strength, confidence, and long-term health through evidence-based training. My coaching philosophy centres around three key principles: <strong>Movement, Muscles, and Mind</strong>. I believe mastering movement quality is the foundation for achieving any fitness goal safely and effectively.<br/><br/></p>",
