            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>Whether you’re completely new to the gym or an experienced athlete looking to improve performance, I create personalised programmes that match your goals, biomechanics, and experience level. Every plan is built using the latest exercise science to maximise results while reducing injury risk.</p>",
