            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>Alongside training, I provide practical nutrition guidance, including calorie and macronutrient targets, helping clients build sustainable habits rather than relying on quick fixes. I offer one-to-one coaching, small group sessions, hybrid coaching, and app-based programmes to suit different lifestyles.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
